<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Build projects from scratch wit=
hout frameworks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Focus on understanding "why" be=
hind every tool</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Practice code reviews v=C3=A0 t=
echnical discussions</li>
</ul>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1"><strong>For Mid Engine=
ers (2-5 years):</strong></h4>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
