<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Global Scale Requires R=
egional Thinking</strong>: Optimize for geography v=C3=A0 local constraints=
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Multiple Fallback Strat=
egies</strong>: Never depend on single path for critical functionality</li>
