<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1"><strong>The Meta-Skill=
: Learning How to Learn</strong></h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Sau 15+ years trong tech industr=
y, the most important skill t=C3=B4i've developed kh=C3=B4ng ph=E1=BA=A3i l=
=C3=A0 any specific technology - it's the ability to quickly understand v=
=C3=A0 master new domains.</p>
