<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Build Mental Models</st=
rong>: Create frameworks for understanding how things connect</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Practice Deliberately</=
strong>: Focus on areas where you're weakest</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Teach Others</strong>: =
You don't truly understand until you can explain it</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Apply in Production</st=
rong>: Real learning happens under real constraints</li>
</ol>
